enames using extracted metadata.\n\n\n**Detailing Cloud Synchronization**\n\nI\'m now detailing the Cloud Sync process, focusing on the Drive API integration. I will verify if the organization\'s folder exists in the root directory and create it if necessary. After that, I will upload the files and record the sync status. The goal is to provide a reliable cloud archiving solution.\n\n\n"
